{{#if isMongoose}}---
description: MongoDB Schema Implementation Guidelines
globs: "**/*.schema.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---
- Define schemas using the `@Schema()` decorator
- Register schemas in `src/common/modules/app-mongoose-models.module.ts`
- Export schema types properly: 
  ```ts
  export type EntityDocument = Entity & Document;
  export const EntitySchema = SchemaFactory.createForClass(Entity);
  ```
- Always add schemas to both imports and exports in the AppMongooseModelsModule
- Use proper Mongoose decorators (@Prop) with appropriate types
- Define indexes for frequently queried fields
@schema-template.ts{{/if}}
